```json
{"summary": "In this room, looking from the entrance, two brown recliners made with soft leather that are plush and deeply cushioned (recliner 1 and recliner 2) face towards a matte black projector made with lightweight metal that is compact and sleek, mounted on the ceiling above a walnut wooden coffee table made with reclaimed wood that is distressed and chunky. A vintage floor lamp made with aged brass metal that is ornate and slightly tarnished is positioned next to recliner 1, while a cognac leather ottoman made with supple hide that is tufted and slightly rounded is placed in front of recliner 2. The wooden coffee table sits atop a beige woven rug made with jute fibers that is textured and slightly frayed at the edges. Against the wall opposite the projector is a black metal shelving unit made with industrial steel that is open-frame and geometric, with a charcoal gray sound system made with brushed metal that is minimalist and angular placed on its left side. A slate gray wall mounted speaker made with matte plastic that is slim and unobtrusive is installed on the wall near the sound system. Hanging above the wooden coffee table is a copper exposed bulb pendant light made with aged metal that is raw and filament-style."}
```

